{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 55,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Israel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jacob, Gen. 32:28"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Israel: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Dan, Joseph, Benjamin, Naphtali, Gad, and Asher."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "From Judah to David"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Judah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Er, Onan, and Shelah. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "These"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three were born to him by the daughter of Shua, the Canaanitess. Er, the firstborn of Judah, was wicked in the sight of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "; so He killed him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Tamar, his daughter-in-law, bore him Perez and Zerah. All the sons of Judah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " five."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Perez "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Hezron and Hamul. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Zerah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Zabdi, Josh. 7:1"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Darda, 1 Kin. 4:31"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Dara—five of them in all."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The son of Carmi "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Achan, Josh. 7:1"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Achar, the troubler of Israel, who transgressed in the accursed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "banned or devoted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " thing."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The son of Ethan "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Azariah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also the sons of Hezron who were born to him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jerahmeel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Aram, Matt. 1:3, 4"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ram, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Caleb, vv. 18, 42"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Chelubai. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ram begot Amminadab, and Amminadab begot Nahshon, leader of the children of Judah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nahshon begot "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Salmon, Ruth 4:21; Luke 3:32"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Salma, and Salma begot Boaz; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Boaz begot Obed, and Obed begot Jesse; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesse begot Eliab his firstborn, Abinadab the second, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Shammah, 1 Sam. 16:9"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shimea the third, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nethanel the fourth, Raddai the fifth, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ozem the sixth, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " David the seventh."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now their sisters "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Zeruiah and Abigail. And the sons of Zeruiah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abishai, Joab, and Asahel—three. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abigail bore Amasa; and the father of Amasa "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jithra the Israelite, 2 Sam. 17:25"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jether the Ishmaelite."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Hezron"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Caleb the son of Hezron had children by Azubah, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " wife, and by Jerioth. Now these were her sons: Jesher, Shobab, and Ardon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Azubah died, Caleb "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. took to himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "took Ephrath"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Ephrathah"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as his wife, who bore him Hur. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Hur begot Uri, and Uri begot Bezalel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now afterward Hezron went in to the daughter of Machir the father of Gilead, whom he married when he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sixty years old; and she bore him Segub. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Segub begot Jair,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Reckoned to Manasseh through the daughter of Machir, Num. 32:41; Deut. 3:14; 25:5, 6; 1 Kin. 4:13; 1 Chr. 7:14"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who had twenty-three cities in the land of Gilead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(Geshur and Syria took from them the towns of Jair, with Kenath and its towns—sixty towns.) All these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "belonged to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Machir the father of Gilead. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After Hezron died in Caleb Ephrathah, Hezron’s wife Abijah bore him Ashhur the father of Tekoa."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Jerahmeel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Jerahmeel, the firstborn of Hezron, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ram, the firstborn, and Bunah, Oren, Ozem, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahijah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jerahmeel had another wife, whose name was Atarah; she was the mother of Onam. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Ram, the firstborn of Jerahmeel, were Maaz, Jamin, and Eker. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Onam were Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Nadab and Abishur."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the name of the wife of Abishur "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abihail, and she bore him Ahban and Molid. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Nadab "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Seled and Appaim; Seled died without children. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The son of Appaim "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ishi, the son of Ishi "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Sheshan, and Sheshan’s son "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Ahlai. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Jada, the brother of Shammai, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jether and Jonathan; Jether died without children. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Jonathan "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Peleth and Zaza. These were the sons of Jerahmeel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Sheshan had no sons, only daughters. And Sheshan had an Egyptian servant whose name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jarha. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sheshan gave his daughter to Jarha his servant as wife, and she bore him Attai. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Attai begot Nathan, and Nathan begot Zabad; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Zabad begot Ephlal, and Ephlal begot Obed; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Obed begot Jehu, and Jehu begot Azariah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Azariah begot Helez, and Helez begot Eleasah; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Eleasah begot Sismai, and Sismai begot Shallum; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shallum begot Jekamiah, and Jekamiah begot Elishama."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Caleb"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The descendants of Caleb the brother of Jerahmeel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Mesha, his firstborn, who was the father of Ziph, and the sons of Mareshah the father of Hebron. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The sons of Hebron "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Korah, Tappuah, Rekem, and Shema. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shema begot Raham the father of Jorkoam, and Rekem begot Shammai. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the son of Shammai "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Maon, and Maon "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the father of Beth Zur."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ephah, Caleb’s concubine, bore Haran, Moza, and Gazez; and Haran begot Gazez. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 47,
                    "num_str": "47",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the sons of Jahdai "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 48,
                    "num_str": "48",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Maachah, Caleb’s concubine, bore Sheber and Tirhanah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 49,
                    "num_str": "49",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "She also bore Shaaph the father of Madmannah, Sheva the father of Machbenah and the father of Gibea. And the daughter of Caleb "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Achsah."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Achsa"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 50,
                    "num_str": "50",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These were the descendants of Caleb: The sons of Hur, the firstborn of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Ephrath, v. 19"
                        },
                        {
